fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"pbutils/gstpbutilscodecutils.html#gst_codec_utils_h266_caps_set_level_tier_and_profile","fragment":"\n\tgst_codec_utils_h266_caps_set_level_tier_and_profile\n\n\n\tGstPbutils.prototype.codec_utils_h266_caps_set_level_tier_and_profile\n\n\n\tGstPbutils.codec_utils_h266_caps_set_level_tier_and_profile\n\nSets the level, tier and profile in caps if it can be determined from\ndecoder_configuration. See gst_codec_utils_h266_get_level,\ngst_codec_utils_h266_get_tier and gst_codec_utils_h266_get_profile\nfor more details on the parameters.\nParameters:\nthe GstCaps to which the level, tier and profile are to be added\nPointer to the VvcDecoderConfigurationRecord struct as defined in ISO/IEC 14496-15\nLength of the data available in decoder_configuration.\nTRUE if the level, tier, profile could be set, FALSE otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nSets the level, tier and profile in caps if it can be determined from\ndecoder_configuration. See GstPbutils.prototype.codec_utils_h266_get_level,\nGstPbutils.prototype.codec_utils_h266_get_tier and GstPbutils.prototype.codec_utils_h266_get_profile\nfor more details on the parameters.\nParameters:\nthe Gst.Caps to which the level, tier and profile are to be added\nPointer to the VvcDecoderConfigurationRecord struct as defined in ISO/IEC 14496-15\nLength of the data available in decoder_configuration.\ntrue if the level, tier, profile could be set, false otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nSets the level, tier and profile in caps if it can be determined from\ndecoder_configuration. See GstPbutils.codec_utils_h266_get_level,\nGstPbutils.codec_utils_h266_get_tier and GstPbutils.codec_utils_h266_get_profile\nfor more details on the parameters.\nParameters:\nthe Gst.Caps to which the level, tier and profile are to be added\nPointer to the VvcDecoderConfigurationRecord struct as defined in ISO/IEC 14496-15\nLength of the data available in decoder_configuration.\nTrue if the level, tier, profile could be set, False otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});